{"t":"SMR","made":"2026-11-13 00:57","name":"NuScale Power Corporation","ko":"뉴스케일","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Specialty Industrial Machinery","employees":428,"hq":"Corvallis, OR, United States","website":"https://www.nuscalepower.com","summary_en":"NuScale Power Corporation provides small modular reactor technology solutions. It offers NuScale Power Module (NPM), a light water nuclear reactor that can generate 77 megawatts of electricity (MWe). The company also provides design and nuclear regulatory licensing basis information to construct and operate the power plant; and licensing, design, development, construction, operation, and maintenance of the power plant. In addition, it offers regulatory licensing support services; start-up testing and commissioning support; accredited training programs to support initial and ongoing power plant operations; management of all aspects of the U.S. Nuclear Regulatory Commission required inspections, tests, analysis, and acceptance criteria process; NuScale Power Module mechanical handling; initial and ongoing fuel bundle loading and movement; design engineering management during commercial operation; operations and maintenance program management; procurement and spare parts management; nuclear fuel management, including reload analysis; and outage planning and execution support services. The company has a strategic partnership with Ebara Elliott Energy for the development, demonstration, and testing of industrial scale compressors using power modules. NuScale Power Corporation was founded in 2007 and is headquartered in Corvallis, Oregon.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"NuScale Power Corporation은 소형 모듈형 원자로 기술 솔루션을 제공합니다. 77메가와트(MWe)의 전력을 생산할 수 있는 경수형 원자로인 NuScale Power Module(NPM)을 제공합니다. 회사는 또한 발전소 건설 및 운영을 위한 설계 및 원자력 규제 인허가 기반 정보를 제공합니다. 발전소의 라이센스, 설계, 개발, 건설, 운영 및 유지 관리. 또한 규제 라이센스 지원 서비스도 제공합니다. 시동 테스트 및 시운전 지원; 초기 및 지속적인 발전소 운영을 지원하기 위한 공인 교육 프로그램; 미국 원자력 규제 위원회에서 요구하는 검사, 테스트, 분석 및 승인 기준 프로세스의 모든 측면을 관리합니다. NuScale 전력 모듈의 기계적 취급; 초기 및 진행 중인 연료 다발 적재 및 이동; 상업 운영 중 설계 엔지니어링 관리; 운영 및 유지보수 프로그램 관리; 조달 및 예비 부품 관리; 재장전 분석을 포함한 핵연료 관리; 정전 계획 및 실행 지원 서비스. 이 회사는 전력 모듈을 사용하는 산업용 규모 압축기의 개발, 시연 및 테스트를 위해 Ebara Elliott Energy와 전략적 파트너십을 맺고 있습니다. NuScale Power Corporation은 2007년에 설립되었으며 오리건주 코발리스에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":5.065,"mcap":2079392128.0,"pe":null,"fpe":-7.556093,"peg":null,"ps":761.9612,"pb":1.0273834,"ev_ebitda":4.691,"div":0.0,"beta":2.429,"hi52":25.57,"lo52":4.275},"fin":{"rev":2729000.0,"rev_g":-0.966,"eps_g":null,"gross":-0.02162,"op":90.9945,"net":0.0,"roe":-0.17122999,"fcf":-231772496.0,"cash":933390976.0,"debt":6634000.0,"de":0.336,"eps":-1.17,"feps":-0.67032},"own":{"short":0.2636,"inst":0.62450004,"insider":0.01699},"analyst":{"n":16,"mean":8.59375,"median":8.0,"high":19.0,"low":3.5,"rec":"hold","recMean":2.84211,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":1,"buy":5,"hold":8,"sell":3,"strongSell":2},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":1,"buy":5,"hold":8,"sell":2,"strongSell":2},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":1,"buy":5,"hold":9,"sell":2,"strongSell":1},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":1,"buy":5,"hold":10,"sell":1,"strongSell":1}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-11-06","Firm":"Citigroup","ToGrade":"Sell","FromGrade":"Sell","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":3.5,"priorPriceTarget":4.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-06","Firm":"Canaccord Genuity","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":11.0,"priorPriceTarget":15.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-06","Firm":"RBC Capital","ToGrade":"Sector Perform","FromGrade":"Sector Perform","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":5.0,"priorPriceTarget":7.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-06","Firm":"Cantor Fitzgerald","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":15.0,"priorPriceTarget":20.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-03","Firm":"Wedbush","ToGrade":"Underper